  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$I_{\\mathrm{rms}}=10 \\mathrm{~A}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & I_{r m s}=\\frac{I_0}{\\sqrt{2}} \\Rightarrow I_0=\\sqrt{2} \\times 10=10 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ & \\text { Max. P.D. }=\\sqrt{2} \\times 10 \\times 12=120 \\times 1.414=169.68 \\mathrm{~V}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
